    // ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    // CONT-28 W1 (F-NEW-516 family root fix): f141 null-contract battery.
    //
    // The census family (batch-3/4, issue #387): R8 compiles its implicit
    // null-check instrumentation as an IMMEDIATE X.getClass() on factory
