                // (probe fnew328: child lp (MATCH,48) read as (-1,-1) →
                // child 1080x1920). Law: lp_* is authoritative when set
                // (not the INT_MIN unset sentinel); the legacy mirrors
                // keep their role for nodes whose lp was never written.
