        // dimension in px at the reference density — here ONE evaluation at
        // the device density: applyDimension law, density/160 for dp/sp).
        // The XML-vector shell previously kept intrinsic -1 (the raster
        // branch above only filled bitmap-backed drawables), so every
        // wrap_content/Glide-style consumer saw "no intrinsic size".
