        // new exception type).
        // ── F-NEW-247: TreeSet pop-family SINGLE-STORE read-through ────
        // UPSTREAM LAW (OpenJDK TreeSet.java): first()/last() return the
        // set's min/max element; pollFirst()/pollLast() remove-and-return
